    "body": "Fixes #1021\r\n\r\n- Added timeout to websocket wait loop using mint quote expiry,\r\n  preventing indefinite hang when invoice is never paid\r\n- Put \"Invoice paid\" output behind paid state check so it only\r\n  prints when minting actually succeeded\r\n\r\nTested by setting `fakewallet_brr=False` to disable auto invoice\r\npayment, then running `cashu invoice 99` and waiting ~10 minutes.\r\nConsole correctly output \"Invoice is not paid yet, stopping\r\ncheck...\" with no misleading \"Invoice paid\" message.",
